rooms_desc ({"It seems that you are somewhere near to the mid of the Earth.It is very dark here. You don't feel very secure here nearto the Drows. You begin to feel uneasy.The room is filled with magic power, so there are manycracks in the dimensions, which you can (perhaps) enter.There are tunnel to the north and the west. The tunnel tothe west is blocked by a very big stone.To the east there is a tunnel leading further down tothe Drows, but you dare not to enter!","A tunnel leading to the DROWs.","You are surrounded by massive stone.You can see runes on the walls and feel the energie in the air.To your left you can see a bush of night roses.To the north there is the door to Dyuarz's home.","This is the entrance hall of Dyuarz home.The walls are out of massive stone. The torches onthe walls are burning in a very strange color.There is a very expensive carpet on the floor.","The stairways are leading further up.","You are now in Dyuarz kitchen.To the north wall there is a cooking-stove.In the mid of the room there is a big table and on thewalls there are many cupboards.","You are now in Dyuarz's living room.There are many tables, chairs, couches, etc 'roundhere. This room is so high, that you can't see the ceiling.","There is something strange in this room, butyou cannot realize what it is.","You are in the room where Dyuarz makes all hisexperiments. There are many books on the shelves.There is a table to the north wall and a couchto the south wall. The air is filled with powerof dark. This not a place to stay long.","You entered the bedroom.It looks very comfortable here... at least for DARKELFs.You can see a black tester-bed and a cupboard. There standsa black light absorbing mirror on the cupboard.",})
