items ({({"stone","It is a very big stone blocking the tinnel to the west.","east tunnel","You can feel the evil beyond this tunnel.",}),0,({"runes","These runes seem to be protection runes","wall","You see runes engraved on the walls","walls","You see runes engraved on the walls","rose","These roses are the only flowers that grow in the darkness","roses","These roses are the only flowers that grow in the darkness",}),({"carpet","It is made out of the golden hair of tortured mermaids.","torch","They look like nothing you have seen before.","wall","You can sense the dark power of Dyuarz stored in the walls",}),0,({"cooking-stove","This model is heated by magic.","cupboard","They are full with food and all the stuff","table","The wood of this table is BLACK!",}),0,0,({"shelf","The shelves are made out of the bones of elven babies.","table","There are some experiments build up on the table","book","The black books have golden letters. You dare not to touch",}),({"bed","It is made out of the skull of a golden dragon","mirror","You wonder for what this is used","cupboard","It is closed",}),})
